<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55419" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατατομή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>incision, notch, groove</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.8.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>Je.</u>
				31
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				48
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνευ -τομῆς</span>”
				<i>uncarved, smooth,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					IG
					12.372.134
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				373.231
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.67
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>part of a theatre</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Dem.Fr.</u>
				3
			</span></i>: variously expld. as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρχήστρα</span>
			 or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάζωμα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				270
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>face</i> of rock, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέγραψεν ἐπὶ τὴν κ. τῆς πέτρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philoch.
					138
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέταλλον καὶ κ.</span> perh. a
			mine and a <i>quarry-face,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1582.70
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταγραφή</span>
			, <i>profile</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (s.h.v.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>mutilation</i>, opp. true <i>circumcision</i>, a <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρονομασία</span> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Phil.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>.</div>
